<title>USA: Texas/w Okla fed cattle market at standstill- USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla fed cattle market at standstill- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was at a standstill in the Panhandle area Monday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers not tested. Feedlots reporting good inquiry from buyers. 1,100 head confirmed for the week to date.</p>
<p>Confirmed - None     Week Ago - None    Year Ago - Holiday</p>
<p>Wk to date - 1,100   Week Ago - 7,600   Year Ago - 400</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
